        "type": "Dialog",
        "title": "Dialog",
        "body": "马寡妇: “那行。没事就好。有啥事，记得言语一声。”",
        "x": 3240,
        "y": 1240,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 79,
        "turns": [
          {
            "speaker": "马寡妇",
